ible for orders delivered to incorrect addresses provided by the customer.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Shipping Restrictions</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Some products may have shipping restrictions based on geographic location or local regulations.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Customers must verify and comply with these restrictions before placing an order.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Delivery Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Once your order is delivered, you will receive a confirmation email or SMS with relevant details, including tracking information (if applicable).</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Digital products will be delivered via email or through your SelfShop account.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Shipping Delays</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>While we strive to meet delivery timelines, external factors such as weather, customs delays, or logistical issues may cause delays. We appreciate your patience in such cases.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Returns Due to Non-Delivery</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>If an order is returned due to non-delivery (e.g., incorrect address), the customer will be responsible for any additional shipping costs to resend the order.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Contact Us</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns about your order or our delivery policy, feel free to contact our customer service team:<br />\r\n📞 <strong>01976367981</strong><br />\r\n📧 <strong>support@selfshop.com</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We appreciate your trust in <strong>SelfShop</strong> and look forward to serving you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">একজন</