ে</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">সেহেতু</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">আমাদের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">নির্দিষ্ট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">কোন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">স্টক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">সম্পর্কে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">জানানো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">সম্ভব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">নয়।</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মাঝে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মাঝে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">আমাদের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">অনেক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">স্টক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">থাকতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">পারে</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">আবার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মাঝে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মাঝে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">প্রোডাক্ট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">স্টক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">আউট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">হ