ইঞ্চি।<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">L= বডি ৩৮ ইঞ্চি, লং ২৪ ইঞ্চি।<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">XL= বডি ৪০ ইঞ্চি, লং ২৫ ইঞ্চি।</p></div><button id=\"copyButton\" class=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0.2rem; margin: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px !important; line-height: 1.5; overflow: visible; text-transform: none; appearance: button; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(40, 167, 69); text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; background-color: transparent; border: 1px solid rgb(40, 167, 69); padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; transition: color 0.15s ease-in-out, background-color 0.15s ease-in-out, border-color 0.15s ease-in-out, box-shadow 0.15s ease-in-out;\"></button><div class=\"card-body pl-0 pr-3 pt-2 pb-2 mt-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 1px; padding: 15px; margin-top: 0.5rem !important; border-top: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e2InB_5fT-g\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light pt-1 pb-0 text-center pl-1 pr-1 mr-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-decoration: none; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); display: inline-block; font-weight: 500; text-align: center !important; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; border: 1px solid rgb(248, 249, 250); padding: 0.25rem 0.25rem 0px !important; font-size: 13px !important; line-height: 1.5; border-radius: 0.2rem; transition: color 0.15s ease-in-out, background-color 0.15s ease-in-out, border-color 0.15s ease-in-out, box-shadow 0.15s ease-in-out; margin-right: 0.5rem !important;\"></a></div></div></div></div>','SP#000327',630.00,700.00,700.00,1600.00,1600.00,'0','images/product/image/17662287453939942628','images/product/image/17662287453939942628','[\"1766228745_823894\",\"1766228745_987360\",\"1766228745_246584\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,1,50,0,'Off','Off','On','2-5 days',0.00,0.00,'Off','Off',0.00,'Active',1,0,0,'On','Off','On','Off','On','2025-12-20 17:05:45','2026-02-19 23:36:15'),(335,NULL,NULL,0,'both',445,4,0,184,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"White\"]',NULL,NULL,'HOCO EW78 True Wireless Earbuds','hoco-ew78-true-wireless-earbuds',NULL,'<h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Poppins, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); margin-block: 0px 20px;\">HOCO EW78 True Wireless Earbuds:</h3><h5 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Poppins, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); margin-block: 0px 20px;\">Features:</h5><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 17px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 14px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; --list-mb: 20px; --li-mb: 10px; --li-pl: 17px; margin-block: 0px 20px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\"><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">The HOCO EW78 True Wireless Earbuds offer a reliable and high-quality audio experience. First and foremost, these earbuds are equipped with Bluetooth V5.4 Jerry AC683, which supports protocols like Headset Hands-free, A2DP, and Avrcp. This ensures a smooth connection with your devices. Additionally, the transmission range reaches up to 10 meters, and the transmission frequency lies between 2402-2480MHz.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">Furthermore, the HOCO EW78 features a 13MM speaker with an impedance of 32Ω±15%, delivering a frequency response between 20Hz and 20,000Hz. This means you can enjoy a wide range of sound, from deep bass to crisp treble. The sensitivity rated at 98db±3db, which ensures that even at lower volumes, the sound remains clear.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">In terms of power, the charging box comes with a battery capacity of 300mAh, while each earbud has a 30mAh battery. This allows for approximately 4 hours of talk or music time at 80% volume and a standby time of up to 150 hours. The charging process is quick, taking only about 1 hour to fully charge the earbuds.</li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">Moreover, the earbuds are lightweight, with each earbud weighing just 3.3g, making them comfortable for extended use. The overall size of the earbuds is 49<em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">46</em>20.2mm, which adds to their portability. Additionally, these earbuds support master-slave switching, up and down song switching, calling Siri, binaural calls, and pressure-sensitive operation functions, enhancing their overall functionality and user experience.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 14px; margin-block: 0px 20px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\">&nbsp;</p>','SP#000335',1150.00,1150.00,1150.00,1150.00,1150.00,'0','images/product/image/17681958571294805305','images/product/image/17681958571294805305','[\"1768195857_485151\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,1,50,0,'Off','Off','On','2-5 Days',0.00,0.00,'Off','Off',0.00,'Active',1,0,0,'On','Off','Off','Off','Off','2026-01-12 11:30:57','2026-02-19 23:36:15'),(336,NULL,NULL,0,'both',445,4,0,184,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'HOCO EQ24 Wireless Bluetooth TWS Earbuds','hoco-eq24-wireless-bluetooth-tws-earbuds',NULL,'<h2 class=\"pdp-mod-section-title outer-title\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2a0e.pdp_revamp.0.i7.a38d387cWoOffF\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 24px; font-weight: 500; font-family: Roboto-Medium; font-size: 16px; line-height: 52px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; height: 52px; background: rgb(250, 250, 250);\">Product details of HOCO EQ24 Wireless Bluetooth TWS Earbuds</h2><div class=\"pdp-product-detail\" data-spm=\"product_detail\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><div class=\"pdp-product-desc \" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px 14px 5px 24px; height: auto; overflow-y: hidden;\"><div class=\"html-c